{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Welcome to the Ghost Ship; Where Silence Screams Louder than Words...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/8e12055e3cda64a9ba66fa406b804926.poster.avif?t=1774121945\" width=690 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/8e12055e3cda64a9ba66fa406b804926.webm?t=1774121945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/8e12055e3cda64a9ba66fa406b804926.mp4?t=1774121945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f Pirate Ghost Ship: Silence or Death?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Step into the realm of shadows, where every breath could be your last.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Pirate Ghost Ship</strong>, you take on the role of Jack, a daring protagonist who boards a legendary, cursed vessel that has been drowned in blood and mystery for centuries. Your mission is more than a simple heist; you seek a cursed treasure map that holds the power to bridge the world of the living and the dead. But remember: on this ship, you are not the hunter\u2014you are the prey.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/a3e41593049971180515e92f39ec59c1.avif?t=1774121945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras_big/a3e41593049971180515e92f39ec59c1.avif?t=1774121945 width=1560 height=2340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc80 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survival Stealth Mechanics:</strong> Creep through the shadows and stay out of sight of the cursed crew. One small mistake will draw every vengeful spirit on the ship to your position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Thrilling Action &amp; Combat:</strong> When there is no way to hide, your blade and flintlock are your only allies against grotesque creatures and soulless sailors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immersive Horror Atmosphere:</strong> Experience a gripping blend of <strong>Inside</strong> and <strong>Fahrenheit</strong> style gameplay, filled with jump scares and a heavy, haunting atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Great Escape:</strong> From the dark depths of the hull to the final confrontation with the Captain; can you secure the map and escape by boat to the mysterious island?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd31 &quot;Explore the mystery of the Pirate Ghost Ship&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Created by a solo developer over two years this game is the result of dedication and passion. Your support truly means a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u5e7d\u970a\u8239\u306e\u8c1c\u3092\u89e3\u304d\u660e\u304b\u305b - \u4eca\u3059\u3050\u30a6\u30a3\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u306b\u8ffd\u52a0\u3057\u3088\u3046\uff01</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pirate_Ghost_Ship_1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub