g>The Great Escape:</strong> From the dark depths of the hull to the final confrontation with the Captain; can you secure the map and escape by boat to the mysterious island?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd31 &quot;Explore the mystery of the Pirate Ghost Ship&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Created by a solo developer over two years this game is the result of dedication and passion. Your support truly means a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u5e7d\u970a\u8239\u306e\u8c1c\u3092\u89e3\u304d\u660e\u304b\u305b - \u4eca\u3059\u3050\u30a6\u30a3\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u306b\u8ffd\u52a0\u3057\u3088\u3046\uff01</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","developers":["Hawk Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/c2f1a160410f4ea9edff196be1b0fc807642a8fd/header.jpg?t=1774121945","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4079410/1232525667/7a6e291811767a84586986ba0fb9f75b53061e42/1771102353/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771102673","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4079410/1232525667/7a6e291811767a84586986ba0fb9f75b53061e42/1771102353/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771102673","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4079410/1232525667/7a6e291811767a84586986ba0fb9f75b53061e42/177110